{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bleu Bayou is a challenging  shoot 'em up boss rush with rogue-lite elements, featuring the 8-bit aesthetic of your favorite handheld console.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.poster.avif?t=1757917524\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.webm?t=1757917524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.mp4?t=1757917524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sling your trusty machete and rusty harpoon with\u00a0<i>Breakout</i>-inspired toss-catch mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 15+ bosses to fast-paced combat, or to unique non-combat minigames!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite progression system featuring 50+ unique upgrades!\u00a0Your build is in your hands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your machete, electrify your harpoon, or punish your foes with status effects like Poison, Slow, and Bleed. Grow your upgrade pool even more across subsequent runs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your debts wisely as you fight to stay afloat in the Bayou's harsh, predatory economy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in Time Attack mode to earn powerful rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful player choice and multiple endings put you in control of your destiny!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit aesthetics, with dozens of unlockable color palettes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a723c508024c8468b24ac3cbdc38fcd6.poster.avif?t=1757917524\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a723c508024c8468b24ac3cbdc38fcd6.webm?t=1757917524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a723c508024c8468b24ac3cbdc38fcd6.mp4?t=1757917524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/8921fb7e8dfdf2aa03b8af53aad1d4ba.poster.avif?t=1757917524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/8921fb7e8dfdf2aa03b8af53aad1d4ba.webm?t=1757917524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806790?t=1757917524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806790?t=1757917524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/ba5d81a6043490d102c0f53bd7aacbf1957bec65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757917524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/ba5d81a6043490d102c0f53bd7aacbf1957bec65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757917524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support"